     "file": "hekr109",
     "pages": 9,
     "head": "9 My World of Music How do you relate to music in your life? Today, music is found in a variety of contexts and situations — from reinterpretations of traditional songs, to the latest advertisement or anthem, music is everywhere. Let us explore some of these diverse contexts of music. Shall we start with singing some popular songs? TRADITIONAL MUSIC IN POPULAR CULTURE There are many examples of traditional music, both folk and devotional, that have found their way into popular culture and have been adapted into films or pop music. This helps the music reach a new audience of people who can also enjoy it. Two examples of songs that are traditional in nature and have become very popular are given on next page. ACTIVITY 9.1 Nimbooda Nimbooda Nimbooda nimbooda is a traditional Rajasthani folk song, performed by the Langa and Manganiar musicians. Such songs have been used in films and have ga"
