     "head": "कााव्यंं न भाावेेन विवेना न भाावेेन विवेना रसःः । न भाावेेन विवेना नृत्यंं न भाावेेन विवेना जगत्् ॥ ८॥ Kāvyaṁ na bhāvena vinā, na bhāvena vinā rasaḥ | Na bhāvena vinā nṛtyaṁ, na bhāvena na bhāvena vinā jagat || 8 Poetry cannot exist without emotion, nor can aesthetic essence (rasa) arise without it. Dance cannot exist without emotion — indeed, the world itself cannot exist without emotion. ― Shloka no. 8 from Sangita Damodara by Pandit Shubhankara ch10_DANCE.indd 104ch10_DANCE.indd 104 19-06-2025 16:28:0919-06-2025 16:28:09 Reprint 2026-27"
