     "head": "Athletics is one of the oldest and most basic forms of sport. It is also known as Track and Field and the events of athletics are classified as Track Events, Field Events, and Combined Events. The fundamental skills of athletics are divided into different categories, including running, jumping, and throwing events. Athletics is a multi-physical skill training discipline that emphasises improving physical traits like strength, speed, endurance, agility, flexibility, and coordination. It comprises a wide range of events, including long-distance running, jumping, throwing, and sprinting. Athletics have a positive impact on human development throughout the physical training phase of education. The appropriate operation and physical development of the human body is assured by carefully chosen activities and their application in all age groups and physical education fields. Running, jumping, t"
    },
    {
